+## crates/atm-cli/src/process.rs:40-52 · round 1 · t4
+> let shell = 0;
+
+- [ ] **Hakan Serce** · 2026-11-17T03:31:00Z · c9
+  On Windows this follows the idle process. Find the parent instead?
+  - **claude:0f56a916** · 2026-11-17T03:40:00Z · c10
